00:00:00,834 --> 00:00:01,935
You like me?

2
00:00:02,535 --> 00:00:03,069
Yeah.

3
00:00:03,235 --> 00:00:04,337
You like me?

4
00:00:04,337 --> 00:00:04,971
Yes.

5
00:00:04,971 --> 00:00:05,905
And I like you?

6
00:00:05,905 --> 00:00:06,906
Yeah.

7
00:00:06,906 --> 00:00:08,975
I know you like me, too.

8
00:00:11,711 --> 00:00:12,746
Don't you?

9
00:00:12,746 --> 00:00:14,981
There must've been
some misunderstanding.

10
00:00:14,981 --> 00:00:16,916
Was there something
between us?

11
00:00:19,953 --> 00:00:21,287
- The photo.
- What?

12
00:00:21,654 --> 00:00:23,289
The photo. The Polaroid photo.

13
00:00:23,623 --> 00:00:25,423
- You were just looking at it.
- You saw that?

14
00:00:25,458 --> 00:00:27,618
Weren't you secretly looking
at it because you like me?

15
00:00:28,328 --> 00:00:29,462
What about sending
Hye-won to work away?

16
00:00:29,462 --> 00:00:30,462
Wait.

17
00:00:31,664 --> 00:00:34,834
You're right about the photo
and I did send Hye-won out.

18
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:37,270
But it wasn't because of...

19
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,375
I did it to prevent you
from dating her.

20
00:00:44,644 --> 00:00:46,746
- I don't understand.
- I mean...

21
00:00:46,946 --> 00:00:48,581
You know about
my previous shop.

22
00:00:48,581 --> 00:00:50,550
I shut it down after a scandal
among the employees.

23
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,352
People started to call it
the hub of cheaters.

24
00:00:53,319 --> 00:00:54,587
So, I thought if you two...

25
00:00:56,056 --> 00:00:57,757
I was afraid it might
happen again...

26
00:00:58,658 --> 00:01:00,427
I know it was childish...

27
00:01:02,629 --> 00:01:03,629
I'm sorry.

28
00:01:08,068 --> 00:01:09,068
Eun-ho.

29
00:01:13,807 --> 00:01:14,841
Eun-ho!

30
00:01:15,208 --> 00:01:16,208
Eun...

31
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:19,546
I'm sorry, I need to go home.
